<div class="wrap"><section class="hero"><div><p class="eyebrow">A little browsing. A lovely find.</p><h1>Good finds.<br>Fresh beginnings.</h1><p>Pre-loved treasures meet fresh gifts: books, cozy clothing, playful finds and useful tech. A little something for you and your favorite people.</p><a class="button" href="/collections/christmas-gifts">Find a lovely gift ↗</a> <a href="/collections/all">Shop all finds →</a></div><div class="hero-art" aria-label="Illustrations of resale categories"><div class="object" aria-hidden="true"><img src="{{ 'headphones.svg' | asset_url }}" alt="" width="200" height="200"></div><div class="object" aria-hidden="true"><img src="{{ 'books.svg' | asset_url }}" alt="" width="200" height="200"></div><div class="object" aria-hidden="true"><img src="{{ 'jacket.svg' | asset_url }}" alt="" width="200" height="200"></div><div class="object" aria-hidden="true"><img src="{{ 'bear.svg' | asset_url }}" alt="" width="200" height="200"></div></div></section><div class="trust"><div><strong>Know what you’re getting.</strong> Item-level condition notes</div><div><strong>A second life looks good.</strong> Shop pre-loved favorites</div><div><strong>A shop with a human touch.</strong> Questions? Get in touch</div></div><section class="block" id="gift-picks" aria-labelledby="gift-title"><div class="section-head"><div><p class="eyebrow">Little gifts. Lovely surprises.</p><h2 id="gift-title">Gift picks for your favorite people.</h2></div><a href="/collections/all">Explore every find →</a></div><p>Planners, kids’ sets, stocking stuffers and a few shelf finds. Code <a href="/discount/GIFT15?redirect=%2Fcollections%2Fchristmas-gifts">GIFT15</a> takes 15% off this collection through Sunday, November 1. It does not stack with FIRST15. Check each item’s shipping estimate before you order for a date.</p><div class="categories"><a class="category" href="/collections/christmas-gifts"><b>All Christmas gifts ↗</b></a><a class="category" href="/collections/christmas-gifts?filter.v.price.lte=25&amp;filter.v.availability=1"><b>Gifts $25 & under ↗</b></a><a class="category" href="/collections/toys"><b>Toys ↗</b></a><a class="category" href="/pages/on-the-shelf"><b>Provo shelf ↗</b></a></div><div class="grid">{% assign shown = 0 %}{% for product in collections['christmas-gifts'].products %}{% if product.available %}{% render 'product-card', product: product %}{% assign shown = shown | plus: 1 %}{% if shown == 8 %}{% break %}{% endif %}{% endif %}{% endfor %}</div><p class="muted">Prices exclude shipping and applicable tax. Supplier items may arrive separately from Provo shelf items.</p></section><section class="block"><div class="section-head"><h2>What’s buzzing?</h2><a href="/collections/all">Shop all →</a></div><div class="categories">{% assign department_handles = 'christmas-gifts,books,clothing,electronics,games,toys,home-decor,beauty-products,more-finds' | split: ',' %}{% for handle in department_handles %}{% assign category = collections[handle] %}{% if category != blank and category.products_count > 0 %}<a class="category" href="{{ category.url }}"><span aria-hidden="true">{% case category.handle %}{% when 'electronics' %}<img src="{{ 'headphones.svg' | asset_url }}" alt="" width="72" height="72">{% when 'books', 'book-deals' %}<img src="{{ 'books.svg' | asset_url }}" alt="" width="72" height="72">{% when 'clothing' %}<img src="{{ 'jacket.svg' | asset_url }}" alt="" width="72" height="72">{% when 'toys' %}<img src="{{ 'bear.svg' | asset_url }}" alt="" width="72" height="72">{% else %}{% if category.image %}{{ category.image | image_url: width: 150 | image_tag: loading: 'lazy', alt: '' }}{% else %}✦{% endif %}{% endcase %}</span><b>{{ category.title | escape }} ↗</b></a>{% endif %}{% endfor %}</div></section><section class="block"><div class="section-head"><div><p class="eyebrow">On the shelf in Provo</p><h2>Kimberly’s finds. One of each.</h2></div><a href="/pages/on-the-shelf">See the shelf →</a></div><div class="grid">{% assign shelf_shown = 0 %}{% for product in collections.all.products %}{% if product.vendor == "Bizi Bees" and product.available %}{% render 'product-card', product: product %}{% assign shelf_shown = shelf_shown | plus: 1 %}{% if shelf_shown == 8 %}{% break %}{% endif %}{% endif %}{% endfor %}{% if shelf_shown == 0 %}<p>Browse <a href="/collections/christmas-gifts">Christmas gifts</a> while the shelf is between listings.</p>{% endif %}</div></section><section class="story"><div><p class="eyebrow">The bizi bees way</p><h2>A happy little hive.<br>Full of good finds.</h2></div><div><p>Kimberly’s pre-loved finds sit alongside new items shipped directly by our supplier partners. Look for condition, seller and shipping details on every product.</p><a href="/pages/about">Meet bizi bees →</a></div></section><section class="block"><h2>Found something they’d love?</h2><p>Send a little hint, or introduce a friend to Kimberly’s shop. A small share helps this little hive grow.</p><a class="button secondary" href="mailto:?subject=A%20little%20find%20from%20Bizi%20Bees&amp;body=I%20thought%20you%20might%20like%20Bizi%20Bees%21%20Browse%20their%20gift%20picks%3A%20https%3A%2F%2Fbizibees-store.myshopify.com%2F%3Futm_source%3Demail%26utm_medium%3Dreferral%26utm_campaign%3Dshare_the_hive%23gift-picks">Share the hive by email ↗</a></section><section class="block"><h2>Good finds, clearly described.</h2><p>Read the condition grade, item notes, and what’s included before you choose.</p><a class="button secondary" href="/pages/condition-guide">How we describe condition</a></section></div>
